  "description": "This makes a total of 4 servings of Keto Chicken Meatballs with Tomato Cream Sauce. Each serving comes out to be 667 calories, 53.3g fats, 9.2g net carbs, and 37.2g protein.",
  "servings": 4,
  "yield": [
    "4",
